Format documentation
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Word 97–2003 text reader (src/core/readers/word97.ts) was written from Microsoft's
publicly available "[MS-DOC]: Word (.doc) Binary File Format" specification. No code
from other projects was copied. The WordPerfect and Microsoft Write handling follows
publicly described file layouts; see docs/core-status.md for what is and is not verified.

Run `npm run licenses` for the full list of production dependencies (including transitive
ones) and their declared licences.
